title: Day01MorningPart04_03
---
<<if !$Shelly_hasSpokenTo>>
    Unknown: Hey, remember me?
    -> Uh, sorry! Who are you?
        Unknown: Geez, Does my look really change that much?
    -> Yes, of course!
        Unknown: Really? Then tell me, what's my name?
        -> Shelly?
            Shelly: Wow, you really remember huh?
            <<set $Shelly_knowingHerName = true>>
        -> Barbara?
            Unknown: Unfortunately, you're incorrect
        -> I'm sorry, i lied. I really have no idea!
            Unknown: That's a shame, but at least you're honest.
            <<set $Shelly_honestPoint += 1>>
    <<if $Shelly_knowingHerName == false>>
    Shelly: I'm Shelly, remember the edgy girl from Telok highschool?
    Shelly: The one who sit at the back, and always on her phone?
    <<endif>>
    Shelly: Haven't seen you since a while. How have you been?
    -> I have been doing fine!
        Shelly: That's good.
        <<set $Shelly_positivePoint += 1>>
    -> I have been struggling a bit lately to be honest.
        Shelly: Ahh I see, been there not gonna lie.
        <<set $Shelly_honestPoint += 1>>
    Shelly: Anyways, what are you doing here?
    Me: Oh, I'm here to take my art design class. What about you?
    Shelly: Math. I think my class is not too far away from yours.
    Shelly: Say, wanna come to lunch with me?
    -> Yes, i would love to!
        Shelly: Great! Then we'll meet at the cafeteria around lunch time.
        Shelly: I'll save you a seat if i got there first.
        <<set $Shelly_likePoint += 1>>
        <<set $Shelly_inviteToLunch = true>>
    -> I'm sorry, I'm busy around that time.
        Shelly: I see. It's alright, but you should make some time exploring the school.
        Shelly: It's actually not that bad compared to highschool. Highschool's suck.
        Me: Haha yeah, that's true. Ok, I will.
    Shelly: Goodbye then!
    <<set $Shelly_hasSpokenTo = true>>
    <<if $Marvin_hasSpokenTo && $Shelly_hasSpokenTo>>
        <<set_object_active "Scene Loader">>
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Shelly: As much as i want to talk, we both have class to attend to.
    Shelly: So go, don't be late especially for your first day.
<<endif>>
===